TED","statement":"Runtime campaigns and machine-code, compiler, runtime or physical-resource assurance are outside scope. The assurance boundary is normative restricted-source execution only, explicitly trusting natural-language correspondence, host tooling, the pinned Lean kernel, hashing and OS/hardware."}],"invariants":[],"liveness_properties":[],"postconditions":[{"acceptance_criteria":["For every valid input x, eval(program.vscore.json, solve, x) returns sum_{i=0}^{n-1} floor((a*i+b)/m).","Each summand q is the unique integer satisfying m*q <= a*i+b < m*(q+1).","Every valid input with n=0 returns 0.","The preserved examples return -4 for {a:-2,b:1,m:3,n:4} and 0 for {a:100,b:-99,m:7,n:0}; examples do not substitute for universal refinement.","The formal contract binds file program.vscore.json, entry solve, arity 1 and all seven closed source properties: typed_total, deterministic, input_preserved, no_external_io, no_floating_point, pure_data, restricted_runtime_only.","A result-existence theorem or unrelated value equality does not discharge the mixed source/value requirement."],"dependencies":[{"id":"D1","relation":"uses_definition"},{"id":"A1","relation":"assumes"}],"id":"O1","kind":"postcondition","lifecycle":{"END_TO_END_VERIFIED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"PENDING","reason":"No VeriSlop verifier has evaluated this milestone.","scope":[]},"FORMALIZED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"PENDING","reason":"No VeriSlop verifier has evaluated this milestone.","scope":[]},"IMPLEMENTED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"PENDING","reason":"No VeriSlop verifier has evaluated this milestone.","scope":[]},"INTERPRETED":{"evidence_refs":["provenance:tier2:tier2-source-facets-006:A23"],"outcome":"PASS","reason":"Recorded interpretation proposal; not mathematical proof.","scope":["recorded interpretation of the request"]},"LINKED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"PENDING","reason":"No VeriSlop verifier has evaluated this milestone.","scope":[]},"PROVED":{"evidence_refs":[],"