tation":"Value facets are required by default.","origin":"explicit","start_byte":4714},{"document_hash":"sha256:7e8c0d17e78afc93ed267ed2738c4d8d2f739a551f7fe20ff302cecbf8fcd83b","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-006:A23","end_byte":6207,"interpretation":"Exact O1 source-facet policy.","origin":"explicit","start_byte":5156}],"state":"INTERPRETED","statement":"For every input satisfying A1, execution of the actual admitted solve entry of arity 1 in canonical program.vscore.json returns exactly the integer sum over 0 <= i < n of floor((a*i+b)/m), where floor rounds toward negative infinity. For n=0 the result is 0. Universal implementation refinement must connect this formula to that source entry under normative Lean vscore-semantics/0.3 and data-pipeline/0.3. Its formal contract must also require typed_total, deterministic, input_preserved, no_external_io, no_floating_point, pure_data and restricted_runtime_only for that file and entry."},{"acceptance_criteria":["The file is program.vscore.json with exactly one admitted typed entry solve of arity 1 in canonical vscore/0.3.","For every valid JSON input x, admitted typed execution and data-pipeline/0.3 serialization return the JSON integer sum_{i=0}^{n-1} floor((a*i+b)/m), including zero when n=0.","The input/output structure and exact ordering follow the specified serialization profile without modifying input values.","The formal contract includes typed_total, deterministic, input_preserved, no_external_io, no_floating_point, pure_data and restricted_runtime_only for the actual file and entry.","Universal refinement establishes both the functional value proposition and source requirements; neither an existence theorem nor a value equality alone replaces them."],"dependencies":[{"id":"D1","relation":"uses_definition"},{"id":"A1","relation":"assumes"}],"id":"O2","kind":"postcondition","lifecycle":{"END_TO_END_VERIFIED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"PENDING","reason":"No VeriSlop verifier has evaluated this miles